# scripts/opcount: `irframe bench ownstatic N` calls a body that owns one
# value it does not write N times (the static release form, P-L8): the
# reference ownlist's list form is measured against. The control defers
# the value's close.
unit call
sizes 409600 2457600
args bench ownstatic {n}
control benchmarks/frame/testdata/control
